## Series-Specific Components

### Season Selector Pattern

The `SeasonSelector` manages season selection and episode loading:

```tsx
import { SeasonSelector } from "@/components/features/series";

<SeasonSelector
  seriesId={series.id}
  seriesName={series.name}
  seasons={series.seasons}
  className="mt-6"
/>
```

Features:
- Dropdown for season selection (defaults to latest season)
- Displays episode count and air date
- Lazy loads episodes via `getSeason()` server action
- Shows loading skeleton while fetching

**Mobile-optimized header layout:**
- Single line: Season dropdown + episode count + air date
- Responsive dropdown width: `w-[140px] sm:w-[180px]`
- Shorter date format on mobile: "Jul 2012" instead of "July 2012"
- Smaller text on mobile: `text-xs sm:text-sm`
- Uses `flex-wrap sm:flex-nowrap` for graceful wrapping only if necessary
- Divider: `|` character between elements with `mx-1.5 text-muted-foreground/50`

